      "regular": 12.84,
      "inStock": false,
      "info": "",
      "short": "<div class=\"desc\">\n<p>Gel forte vsebuje visokokakovostni perna ekstrakt (ekstrakt zelenoustne školjke), izvleček kajenskega popra, glukozaminoglikane (GAG), hondroitin in dragocena, fiziološko aktivna eterična olja. Gel ustvarja intenziven, dolgotrajen in prijeten občutek toplote.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"price_box d-flex align-items-end\">\n<div class=\"price mr-auto d-flex flex-column\"></div>\n</div>",
      "description": "<p>Za ogrevanje pred športnimi aktivnostmi ali sprostitev mišic po naporni vadbi. Izvleček kajenskega popra daje koži prijeten občutek toplote. Eterična olja evkaliptusa, rožmarina, citrusov in mentol blagodejno vplivajo na kožo in z aromatičnimi učinki ugodno vplivajo na organizem.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div id=\"tab_navodila_status\" class=\"tab-pane fade active show\">\n<p>PERNATON® Gel forte večkrat na dan vtrite na prizadete dele, npr. vrat, ramena, hrbet, komolce, roke, kolena, noge in stopala.</p>\n<p>OPOZORILO:</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div id=\"product__single\" class=\"container\" data-product-id=\"17664\" data-product-naziv=\"Pernaton Forte grelni gel, 125 ml\" data-product-cena=\"12.31\">\n<div class=\"row tabs_wrapper\">\n<div class=\"col-md-12\">\n<div class=\"tab-content\">\n<div id=\"tab_opozorilo_status\" class=\"tab-pane fade active show\">\n<p>Samo za zunanjo uporabo. Shranjujte nedosegljivo otrokom. Mesta, kjer ste uporabili Pernaton gel, ne povijajte z zračno neprepustnimi ovoji. Pazite, da izdelek ne zaide v oči.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div id=\"related_products\" class=\"products_wrapper\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__files\">\n<div class=\"files--wrapper\"><main id=\"app\" class=\"\">SESTAVA:</main></p>\n<div id=\"tab_tehnicna_dokumentacija_status\" class=\"tab-pane fade active show\">\n<p>Aqua/water, propylene glycol, alcohol denat., peg-40 hydrogenated castrol oil, niacinamide, capsicum frutescens fruit extract, mussel extract, sodium chondroitin sulfate, glycosaminoglycans, vanillyl butyl ether, zingiber officinale root extract, sorbitol, hydrolyzed soy protein, pentylene glycol, glycerin, 3-aminopropane sulfonic acid, eucalyptus globulus oil, rosmarinus officinalis leaf oil, citrus medica limonum oil, citrus aurantium dulcis oil, camphor, menthol, caffeine, paullinia cupana seed extract, carbomer, sodium hydroxid, methylparaben, parfum, cinnamal, coumarin, eugenol, limonene, linalool, citral, benzyl alcohol, geraniol, anisyl alcohol, benzyl cinnamate, citronellol, hexyl cinnamldehyde, phenoxyethanol, benzoic acid, dehydroacetic acid, sodium hyaluronate.</p>\n<div class=\"product__files\">\n<div class=\"files--wrapper\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div id=\"related_products\" class=\"products_wrapper\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
